    "ep": "011",
    "unit_id": "u0075",
    "t": [
      424.0,
      429.0
    ],
    "speaker": "夏雨",
    "text": "牛腰 你说实话 那牛奶是不是你过到的"
  },
  {
    "series": "jiayouernv",
    "ep": "011",
    "unit_id": "u0076",
    "t": [
      429.0,
      431.0
    ],
    "speaker": "刘星",
    "text": "不是 就不是"
  },
  {
    "series": "jiayouernv",
    "ep": "011",
    "unit_id": "u0077",
    "t": [
      432.0,
      436.0
    ],
    "speaker": "夏雨",
    "text": "爸 牛奶是牛腰 给我到的 是吗"
  },
  {
    "series": "jiayouernv",
    "ep": "011",
    "unit_id": "u0078",
    "t": [
      436.0,
      440.0
    ],
    "speaker": "夏东海",
    "text": "是 去给爸爸倒杯水 快去 没事过来"
  },
  {
    "series": "jiayouernv",
    "ep": "011",
    "unit_id": "u0079",
    "t": [
      443.0,
      450.0
    ],
    "speaker": "夏东海",
    "text": "孩子 走 站起来 我问你 弟弟杯子里牛奶是你到的吗"
  },
  {
    "series": "jiayouernv",
    "ep": "011",
    "unit_id": "u0080",
    "t": [
      450.0,
      454.0
    ],
    "speaker": "刘星",
    "text": "不是说好了吗 不提尿酷子的事啊"
  },
  {
    "series": "jiayouernv",
    "ep": "011",
    "unit_id": "u0081",
    "t": [
      454.0,
      457.0
    ],
    "speaker": "夏东海",
    "text": "我没提酷的事 我在说牛奶的事"
  },
  {
    "series": "jiayouernv",
    "ep": "011",
    "unit_id": "u0082",
    "t": [
      457.0,
      468.0
    ],
    "speaker": "刘星",
    "text": "你看啊 咱儿小鱼的说法来说 他说他尿酷的是 由于喝牛奶一起的对吧 你要是不想提尿酷的呢 就不能提喝牛奶的事"
  },
  {
    "series": "jiayouernv",
    "ep": "011",
    "unit_id": "u0083",
    "t": [
      469.0,
      475.0
    ],
    "speaker": "夏东海",
    "text": "你说得有道理 好好好 那我就不再提尿酷子 喝牛奶的事了"
  },
  {
    "series": "jiayouernv",
    "ep": "011",
    "unit_id": "u0084",
    "t": [
      476.0,
      478.0
    ],
    "speaker": "夏雨",
    "text": "爸 我的事就不管了"
  },
  {
    "series": "jiayouernv",
    "ep": "011",
    "unit_id": "u0085",
    "t": [
      478.0,
      484.0
    ],
    "speaker": "夏东海",
    "text": "管呀 这事还用管吗 事情不多已经听出了吗 是吧 刘兴"
  },
  {
    "series": "jiayouernv",
    "ep": "011",
    "unit_id": "u0086",
    "t": [
      484.0,
      487.0
    ],
    "speaker": "刘星",
    "text": "怎么了 你说什么清了"
  },
  {
    "series": "jiayouernv",
    "ep": "011",
    "unit_id": "u0087",
    "t": [
      488.0,
      493.0
    ],
    "speaker": "夏东海",
    "text": "你说呢 难道你是准备贴尺童雅 死不承认是吗"
  },
  {
    "series": "jiayouernv",
    "ep": "011",
    "unit_id": "u0088",
    "t": [
      494.0,
      496.0
    ],
    "speaker": "刘星",
    "text": "这不得您教我的吗"
  },
  {
    "series": "jiayouernv",
    "ep": "011",
    "unit_id": "u0089",
    "t": [
      496.0,
      499.0
    ],
    "speaker": "夏东海",
    "text": "我教你死不承认了"
  },
  {
    "series": "jiayouernv",
    "ep": "011",
    "unit_id": "u0090",
    "t": [
      499.0,
      502.0
    ],
    "speaker": "刘星",
    "text": "这不您说的吗 做了错事要永远承认"
  },
  {
    "series": "jiayouernv",
    "ep": "011",
    "unit_id": "u0091",
    "t": [
      502.0,
      503.0
    ],
    "speaker": "夏雨",
    "text": "对啊"
  },
  {
    "series": "jiayouernv",
    "ep": "011",
    "unit_id": "u0092",
    "t": [
      503.0,
      506.0
    ],
    "speaker": "刘星",
    "text": "做了好事 就不要承认"
  },
  {
    "series": "jiayouernv",
    "ep": "011",
    "unit_id": "u0093",
    "t": [
      506.0,
      511.0
    ],
    "speaker": "夏东海",
    "text": "那你的意思是 给弟弟杯子里到牛奶 这还是做了好事了"
  },
  {
    "series": "jiayouernv",
    "ep": "011",
    "unit_id": "u0094",
    "t": [
      511.0,
      513.0
    ],
    "speaker": "刘星",
    "text": "对啊 真不明白的呢吗"
  },
  {
    "series": "jiayouernv",
    "ep": "011",
    "unit_id": "u0095",
    "t": [
      513.0,
      516.0
    ],
    "speaker": "夏东海",
    "text": "明白什么呀 你就在这瞎脚边吧"
  },
  {
    "series": "jiayouernv",
    "ep": "011",
    "unit_id": "u0096",
    "t": [
      517.0,
      519.0
    ],
    "speaker": "刘星",
    "text": "是不眼睛教我的吗"
  },
  {
    "series": "jiayouernv",
    "ep": "011",
    "unit_id": "u0097",
    "t": [
      519.0,
      523.0
    ],
    "speaker": "夏东海",
    "text": "我什么时候教你 给弟弟杯子里到牛奶了"
  },
  {
    "series": "jiayouernv",
    "ep": "011",
    "unit_id": "u0098",
    "t": [
      523.0,
      527.0
    ],
    "speaker": "刘星",
    "text": "你还记得吗 你跟我讲过 恐龙让丽的事"
  },
  {
    "series": "jiayouernv",
    "ep": "011",
    "unit_id": "u0099",
    "t": [
      527.0,
      529.0
    ],
    "speaker": "夏东海",
    "text": "忘了啊 就说吧"
  },
  {
    "series": "jiayouernv",
    "ep": "011",
    "unit_id": "u0100",
    "t": [
      529.0,
      531.0
    ],
    "speaker": "刘星",
    "text": "从前有那名小伙子"
  },
  {
    "series": "jiayouernv",
    "ep": "011",
    "unit_id": "u0101",
    "t": [
      531.0,
      535.0
    ],
    "speaker": "夏东海",
    "text": "叫恐龙 恐龙让丽跟这是两马事"
  },
  {
    "series": "jiayouernv",
    "ep": "011",
    "unit_id": "u0102",
    "t": [
      535.0,
      538.0
    ],
    "speaker": "刘星",
    "text": "那就说说您小伙子的事吧"
  },
  {
    "series": "jiayouernv",
    "ep": "011",
    "unit_id": "u0103",
    "t": [
      538.0,
      539.0
    ],
    "speaker": "夏东海",
    "text": "行"
  },
  {
    "series": "jiayouernv",
    "ep": "011",
    "unit_id": "u0104",
    "t": [
      539.0,
      543.0
    ],
    "speaker": "刘星",
    "text": "你说您小伙子家里很穷 还经常接不开锅 没错吧"
  },
  {
    "series": "jiayouernv",
    "ep": "011",
    "unit_id": "u0105",
    "t": [
      543.0,
      544.0
    ],
    "speaker": "夏东海",
    "text": "没错"
  },
  {
    "series": "jiayouernv",
    "ep": "011",
    "unit_id": "u0106",
    "t": [
      544.0,
      546.0
    ],
    "speaker": "刘星",
    "text": "还只能熬点周和 还经常吃不饱"
  },
  {
    "series": "jiayouernv",
    "ep": "011",
    "unit_id": "u0107",
    "t": [
      546.0,
      548.0
    ],
    "speaker": "夏东海",
    "text": "没错吧 没错"
  },
  {
    "series": "jiayouernv",
    "ep": "011",
    "unit_id": "u0108",
    "t": [
      548.0,
      552.0
    ],
    "speaker": "刘星",
    "text": "为了弟弟杯子 还经常省下半碗州 到在弟弟的碗里 没错吧"
  },
  {
    "series": "jiayouernv",
    "ep": "011",
    "unit_id": "u0109",
    "t": [
      552.0,
      553.0
    ],
    "speaker": "夏东海",
    "text": "没错"
  },
  {
    "series": "jiayouernv",
    "ep": "011",
    "unit_id": "u0110",
    "t": [
      553.0,
      556.0
    ],
    "speaker": "刘星",
    "text": "所以我都是人家半杯奶 到在弟弟的杯子里 没错吧"
  },
  {
    "series": "jiayouernv",
    "ep": "011",
    "unit_id": "u0111",
    "t": [
      556.0,
      557.0
    ],
    "speaker": "夏东海",
    "text": "没错"
  },
  {
    "series": "jiayouernv",
    "ep": "011",
    "unit_id": "u0112",
    "t": [
      557.0,
      559.0
    ],
    "speaker": "刘星",
    "text": "这不都结了吗 还有属什么呀"
  },
  {
    "series": "jiayouernv",
    "ep": "011",
    "unit_id": "u0113",
    "t": [
      560.0,
      561.0
    ],
    "speaker": "夏雨",
    "text": "错了"
  },
  {
    "series": "jiayouernv",
    "ep": "011",
    "unit_id": "u0114",
    "t": [
      563.0,
      565.0
    ],
    "speaker": "夏东海",
    "text": "刘新啊 你给我回来"
  },
  {
    "series": "jiayouernv",
    "ep": "011",
    "unit_id": "u0115",
    "t": [
      574.0,
      578.0
    ],
    "speaker": "刘梅",
    "text": "刘新 七点了 你七球要晚了 快点"
  },
  {
    "series": "jiayouernv",
    "ep": "011",
    "unit_id": "u0116",
    "t": [
      593.0,
      595.0
    ],
    "speaker": "夏雨",
    "text": "妈我走了"
  },
  {
    "series": "jiayouernv",
    "ep": "011",
    "unit_id": "u0117",
    "t": [
      595.0,
      596.0
    ],
    "speaker": "刘梅",
    "text": "妈我走了"
  },
  {
    "series": "jiayouernv",
    "ep": "011",
    "unit_id": "u0118",
    "t": [
      611.0,
      615.0
    ],
    "speaker": "刘星",
    "text": "妈快来啊 有了吗 我心里到东南"
  },
  {
    "series": "jiayouernv",
    "ep": "011",
    "unit_id": "u0119",
    "t": [
      615.0,
      620.0
    ],
    "speaker": "刘梅",
    "text": "什么 你吃了 我的妈啊 就肯定是小宇干的"
  },
  {
    "series": "jiayouernv",
    "ep": "011",
    "unit_id": "u0120",
    "t": [
      620.0,
      625.08
    ],
    "speaker": "刘星",
    "text": "你快冷淡了嘛 我快来不及了 今天那比赛特种呀 我还是主力前逢的"
  },
  {
    "series": "jiayouernv",
    "ep": "011",
    "unit_id": "u0121",
    "t": [
      625.08,
      630.28
    ],
    "speaker": "刘梅",
    "text": "行行行 我知道了 这不是正跟你想办法的吗 要不妈在带你买一双去吧"
  },
  {
    "series": "jiayouernv",
    "ep": "011",
    "unit_id": "u0122",
    "t": [
      630.28,
      632.32
    ],
    "speaker": "刘星",
    "text": "我直说来不及了嘛"
  },
  {
    "series": "jiayouernv",
    "ep": "011",
    "unit_id": "u0123",
    "t": [
      632.32,
      638.2
    ],
    "speaker": "刘梅",
    "text": "谁啊 你上次把牛奶 都倒塌背了里去的 就害她之妙阻止 她可不可以报复我们的"
  },
  {
    "series": "jiayouernv",
    "ep": "011",
    "unit_id": "u0124",
    "t": [
      638.2,
      640.24
    ],
    "speaker": "刘星",
    "text": "那一份都把牛奶倒不斜利啊"
  },
  {
    "series": "jiayouernv",
    "ep": "011",
    "unit_id": "u0125",
    "t": [
      640.24,
      641.6
    ],
    "speaker": "夏东海",
    "text": "行了 一大早就让上"
  },
  {
    "series": "jiayouernv",
    "ep": "011",
    "unit_id": "u0126",
    "t": [
      641.6,
      644.56
    ],
    "speaker": "刘梅",
    "text": "你看看这小鱼 把牛奶倒在斜里了"
  },
  {
    "series": "jiayouernv",
    "ep": "011",
    "unit_id": "u0127",
    "t": [
      644.56,
      646.44
    ],
    "speaker": "夏东海",
    "text": "没事 吹风机给她吹干就行了"
  },
  {
    "series": "jiayouernv",
    "ep": "011",
    "unit_id": "u0128",
    "t": [
      646.44,
      647.44
    ],
    "speaker": "刘梅",
    "text": "妈给你能干了"
  },
  {
    "series": "jiayouernv",
    "ep": "011",
    "unit_id": "u0129",
    "t": [
      647.44,
      649.48
    ],
    "speaker": "夏东海",
    "text": "没事 等一会儿就干了"
  },
  {
    "series": "jiayouernv",
    "ep": "011",
    "unit_id": "u0130",
    "t": [
      650.48,
      652.72
    ],
    "speaker": "刘星",
    "text": "那鞋丝都咱们踢 喝"
  },
  {
    "series": "jiayouernv",
    "ep": "011",
    "unit_id": "u0131",
    "t": [
      652.72,
      668.0
    ],
    "speaker": "夏东海",
    "text": "是了 怎么不能踢了 就是干的 你一踢球一出汗 那鞋不装扬屎啊 我还告诉你了 你爸我小时候 连这丝的资趣鞋都没见过 我们那时候都穿蓝看鞋踢 就这样 我还是踢了一个校队的前逢呢"
  },
  {
    "series": "jiayouernv",
    "ep": "011",
    "unit_id": "u0132",
    "t": [
      668.64,
      671.76
    ],
    "speaker": "刘星",
    "text": "你俩前逢 对啊 我踢的可是好好的东西位置"
  },
  {
    "series": "jiayouernv",
    "ep": "011",
    "unit_id": "u0133",
    "t": [
      671.76,
      674.76
    ],
    "speaker": "夏东海",
    "text": "没事啊 这你这小身子 我还踢好好的东西位置呢"
  },
  {
    "series": "jiayouernv",
    "ep": "011",
    "unit_id": "u0134",
    "t": [
      674.76,
      676.36
    ],
    "speaker": "刘星",
    "text": "咱 把他记忆说好"
  },
  {
    "series": "jiayouernv",
    "ep": "011",
    "unit_id": "u0135",
    "t": [
      677.16,
      679.76
    ],
    "speaker": "刘梅",
    "text": "好了 干了 我觉得 你看 多快"
  },
  {
    "series": "jiayouernv",
    "ep": "011",
    "unit_id": "u0136",
    "t": [
      680.4,
      681.68
    ],
    "speaker": "刘星",
    "text": "一股牛奶味"
  },
  {
    "series": "jiayouernv",
    "ep": "011",
    "unit_id": "u0137",
    "t": [
      682.88,
      685.84
    ],
    "speaker": "刘梅",
    "text": "牛奶味怎么了 这跑盖给你的臭脚味"
  },
  {
    "series": "jiayouernv",
    "ep": "011",
    "unit_id": "u0138",
    "t": [
      685.84,
      686.44
    ],
    "speaker": "夏东海",
    "text": "行啊"
  },
  {
    "series": "jiayouernv",
    "ep": "011",
    "unit_id": "u0139",
    "t": [
      688.04,
      690.68
    ],
    "speaker": "夏东海",
    "text": "你听说过 被开汗墓的资趣鞋吗"
  },
  {
    "series": "jiayouernv",
    "ep": "011",
    "unit_id": "u0140",
    "t": [
      690.68,
      691.84
    ],
    "speaker": "刘星",
    "text": "知道 白扫了"
  },
  {
    "series": "jiayouernv",
    "ep": "011",
    "unit_id": "u0141",
    "t": [
      691.84,
      694.44
    ],
    "speaker": "夏东海",
    "text": "你知道为什么是白扫的吗 喝"
  },
  {
    "series": "jiayouernv",
    "ep": "011",
    "unit_id": "u0142",
    "t": [
      694.44,
      696.2
    ],
    "speaker": "刘梅",
    "text": "你不会说是拿牛奶泡的吧"
  },
  {
    "series": "jiayouernv",
    "ep": "011",
    "unit_id": "u0143",
    "t": [
      696.2,
      697.08
    ],
    "speaker": "夏东海",
    "text": "小包上吃的"
  },
  {
    "series": "jiayouernv",
    "ep": "011",
    "unit_id": "u0144",
    "t": [
      698.56,
      699.92
    ],
    "speaker": "刘梅",
    "text": "你爸还真有想象厉害"
  },
  {
    "series": "jiayouernv",
    "ep": "011",
    "unit_id": "u0145",
    "t": [
      699.92,
      704.76
    ],
    "speaker": "刘星",
    "text": "他那想象厉不过我 你应该直接说 这鞋就是奶牛胜的"
  },
  {
    "series": "jiayouernv",
    "ep": "011",
    "unit_id": "u0146",
    "t": [
      704.76,
      706.4
    ],
    "speaker": "刘梅",
    "text": "行 红丝无缠纸"
  },
  {
    "series": "jiayouernv",
    "ep": "011",
    "unit_id": "u0147",
    "t": [
      707.4,
      717.56
    ],
    "speaker": "夏东海",
    "text": "我告诉你 这踢球一半靠平时训练 一半就要靠林厂发挥 还有这个鞋上厉 到时候你就把自己鞋上成 被开汗墓 开过人过人 开过来了"
  },
  {
    "series": "jiayouernv",
    "ep": "011",
    "unit_id": "u0148",
    "t": [
      717.56,
      725.2
    ],
    "speaker": "刘梅",
    "text": "行了 行了 还被开汗 那敲他你得行 快走吧 爱不及了 多敬几个球回来"
  },
  {
    "series": "jiayouernv",
    "ep": "011",
    "unit_id": "u0149",
    "t": [
      736.4,
      738.8
    ],
    "speaker": "刘梅",
    "text": "看你 看你 看你"
  },
  {
    "series": "jiayouernv",
    "ep": "011",
    "unit_id": "u0150",
    "t": [
      738.8,
      743.8
    ],
    "speaker": "刘星",
    "text": "看你 看你 看你 看你 看你"
  },
  {
    "series": "jiayouernv",
    "ep": "011",
    "unit_id": "u0151",
    "t": [
      743.8,
      748.8
    ],
    "speaker": "夏雨",
    "text": "看你 看你 看你 看你 看你"
  },
  {
    "series": "jiayouernv",
    "ep": "011",
    "unit_id": "u0152",
    "t": [
      755.8,
      757.12
    ],
    "speaker": "夏雨",
    "text": "温温 我们也回来了"
  },
  {
    "series": "jiayouernv",
    "ep": "011",
    "unit_id": "u0153",
    "t": [
      757.12,
      759.28
    ],
    "speaker": "姥姥",
    "text": "你这孩子 他不想一天我"
  },
  {
    "series": "jiayouernv",
    "ep": "011",
    "unit_id": "u0154",
    "t": [
      759.28,
      761.92
    ],
    "speaker": "夏雨",
    "text": "温温 温温 温温"
  },
  {
    "series": "jiayouernv",
    "ep": "011",
    "unit_id": "u0155",
    "t": [
      761.92,
      762.84
    ],
    "speaker": "姥姥",
    "text": "还没回来呢"
  },
  {
    "series": "jiayouernv",
    "ep": "011",
    "unit_id": "u0156",
    "t": [
      762.84,
      765.12
    ],
    "speaker": "夏雨",
    "text": "那就好那就好 好 拿走"
  },
  {
    "series": "jiayouernv",
    "ep": "011",
    "unit_id": "u0157",
    "t": [
      765.72,
      768.72
    ],
    "speaker": "姥姥",
    "text": "怎么了 您俩 你找她干吗呀"
  },
  {
    "series": "jiayouernv",
    "ep": "011",
    "unit_id": "u0158",
    "t": [
      769.52,
      771.32
    ],
    "speaker": "夏雨",
    "text": "你也借我借我呀"
  },
  {
    "series": "jiayouernv",
    "ep": "011",
    "unit_id": "u0159",
    "t": [
      771.52,
      774.32
    ],
    "speaker": "姥姥",
    "text": "跟老了说 怎么了 你们俩 您说啊"
  },
  {
    "series": "jiayouernv",
    "ep": "011",
    "unit_id": "u0160",
    "t": [
      778.12,
      783.32
    ],
    "speaker": "姥姥",
    "text": "你说你这孩子 你那牛奶往哪儿倒不行啊 你偏倒得足球鞋里头"
  },
  {
    "series": "jiayouernv",
    "ep": "011",
    "unit_id": "u0161",
    "t": [
      783.52,
      786.72
    ],
    "speaker": "夏雨",
    "text": "是啊 当然是嘛 牛奶 倒得我背着你倒"
  },
  {
    "series": "jiayouernv",
    "ep": "011",
    "unit_id": "u0162",
    "t": [
      786.72,
      788.12
    ],
    "speaker": "姥姥",
    "text": "那你跟她学呀"
  },
  {
    "series": "jiayouernv",
    "ep": "011",
    "unit_id": "u0163",
    "t": [
      788.32,
      790.12
    ],
    "speaker": "夏雨",
    "text": "不大 我才能学"
  },
  {
    "series": "jiayouernv",
    "ep": "011",
    "unit_id": "u0164",
    "t": [
      790.12,
      792.52
    ],
    "speaker": "姥姥",
    "text": "跟老了说话 是吧 我也不管了"
  },
  {
    "series": "jiayouernv",
    "ep": "011",
    "unit_id": "u0165",
    "t": [
      792.72,
      796.72
    ],
    "speaker": "夏雨",
    "text": "老了 您不能见死不救啊"
  },
  {
    "series": "jiayouernv",
    "ep": "011",
    "unit_id": "u0166",
    "t": [
      797.72,
      803.92
    ],
    "speaker": "姥姥",
    "text": "小雨啊 我可跟你说啊 刘星今天这球要是赢了 你这事还好吧"
  },
  {
    "series": "jiayouernv",
    "ep": "011",
    "unit_id": "u0167",
    "t": [
      804.12,
      805.32
    ],
    "speaker": "夏雨",
    "text": "你要说呢"
  },
  {
    "series": "jiayouernv",
    "ep": "011",
    "unit_id": "u0168",
    "t": [
      805.32,
      807.92
    ],
    "speaker": "姥姥",
    "text": "说不来啊 老罗都不知道怎么办"
  },
  {
    "series": "jiayouernv",
    "ep": "011",
    "unit_id": "u0169",
    "t": [
      808.92,
      813.32
    ],
    "speaker": "夏雨",
    "text": "老了 怎么办 他可怜 我太心了 我也打过怎么办"
  },
  {
    "series": "jiayouernv",
    "ep": "011",
    "unit_id": "u0170",
    "t": [
      814.12,
      815.12
    ],
    "speaker": "姥姥",
    "text": "听老罗话不听"
  },
  {
    "series": "jiayouernv",
    "ep": "011",
    "unit_id": "u0171",
    "t": [
      815.32,
      816.52
    ],
    "speaker": "夏雨",
    "text": "听 听啊"
  },
  {
    "series": "jiayouernv",
    "ep": "011",
    "unit_id": "u0172",
    "t": [
      817.12,
      825.72
    ],
    "speaker": "姥姥",
    "text": "先下老罗顾待着钱 把他作业写完了 不叫你不许出来 去吧 老罗跟她说啊"
  },
  {
    "series": "jiayouernv",
    "ep": "011",
    "unit_id": "u0173",
    "t": [
      826.52,
      832.12
    ],
    "speaker": "刘星",
    "text": "小雨 小雨呢 老了 您来了 好了 好"
  },
  {
    "series": "jiayouernv",
    "ep": "011",
    "unit_id": "u0174",
    "t": [
      833.72,
      834.92
    ],
    "speaker": "姥姥",
    "text": "你找小雨什么事儿的"
  },
  {
    "series": "jiayouernv",
    "ep": "011",
    "unit_id": "u0175",
    "t": [
      835.12,
      836.92
    ],
    "speaker": "刘星",
    "text": "我跟她说打事儿 小雨"
  },
  {
    "series": "jiayouernv",
    "ep": "011",
    "unit_id": "u0176",
    "t": [
      837.52,
      842.92
    ],
    "speaker": "姥姥",
    "text": "刘星呢 你先跟我说 今天你这个球啊 是赢了 还是输了"
  },
  {
    "series": "jiayouernv",
    "ep": "011",
    "unit_id": "u0177",
    "t": [
      843.52,
      844.52
    ],
    "speaker": "刘星",
    "text": "我带着的 您说"
  },
  {
    "series": "jiayouernv",
    "ep": "011",
    "unit_id": "u0178",
    "t": [
      844.52,
      850.32
    ],
    "speaker": "姥姥",
    "text": "小雨 你啊 必须先告诉我 你是输了 还是赢了"
  },
  {
    "series": "jiayouernv",
    "ep": "011",
    "unit_id": "u0179",
    "t": [
      851.52,
      855.52
    ],
    "speaker": "刘星",
    "text": "听识 你也不关心 我替足球的事 你们今天"
  },
  {
    "series": "jiayouernv",
    "ep": "011",
    "unit_id": "u0180",
    "t": [
      856.12,
      860.32
    ],
    "speaker": "姥姥",
    "text": "我今天呢 就想知道 你是赢了 还是输了"
  },
  {
    "series": "jiayouernv",
    "ep": "011",
    "unit_id": "u0181",
    "t": [
      860.72,
      863.52
    ],
    "speaker": "刘星",
    "text": "这跟我找小雨有什么关系 小雨"
  },
  {
    "series": "jiayouernv",
    "ep": "011",
    "unit_id": "u0182",
    "t": [
      864.12,
      865.12
    ],
    "speaker": "姥姥",
    "text": "还有关系了"
  },
  {
    "series": "jiayouernv",
    "ep": "011",
    "unit_id": "u0183",
    "t": [
      865.32,
      867.52
    ],
    "speaker": "刘星",
    "text": "对对对 告诉你 五比零"
  },
  {
    "series": "jiayouernv",
    "ep": "011",
    "unit_id": "u0184",
    "t": [
      869.12,
      875.12
    ],
    "speaker": "姥姥",
    "text": "五比零是什么意思 你是五比零 赢了呢 你还是零比五输了"
  },
  {
    "series": "jiayouernv",
    "ep": "011",
    "unit_id": "u0185",
    "t": [
      877.12,
      877.92
    ],
    "speaker": "姥姥",
    "text": "输了"
  },
  {
    "series": "jiayouernv",
    "ep": "011",
    "unit_id": "u0186",
    "t": [
      878.52,
      879.32
    ],
    "speaker": "刘星",
    "text": "输了"
  },
  {
    "series": "jiayouernv",
    "ep": "011",
    "unit_id": "u0187",
    "t": [
      881.92,
      887.52
    ],
    "speaker": "姥姥",
    "text": "刘星呢 我跟你说 小雨这孩子呀 他年纪小不懂事儿"
  },
  {
    "series": "jiayouernv",
    "ep": "011",
    "unit_id": "u0188",
    "t": [
      887.52,
      891.92
    ],
    "speaker": "刘星",
    "text": "你跟我说 你跟我说这一干嘛呀 我就是问你 小雨都回了没有"
  },
  {
    "series": "jiayouernv",
    "ep": "011",
    "unit_id": "u0189",
    "t": [
      892.32,
      894.92
    ],
    "speaker": "姥姥",
    "text": "没有 谢谢 还没回来"
  },
  {
    "series": "jiayouernv",
    "ep": "011",
    "unit_id": "u0190",
    "t": [
      895.52,
      898.12
    ],
    "speaker": "刘星",
    "text": "肯定是在二胖家 我正就等着去"
  },
  {
    "series": "jiayouernv",
    "ep": "011",
    "unit_id": "u0191",
    "t": [
      899.12,
      899.72
    ],
    "speaker": "姥姥",
    "text": "刘星啊"
  },
  {
    "series": "jiayouernv",
    "ep": "011",
    "unit_id": "u0192",
    "t": [
      902.92,
      908.72
    ],
    "speaker": "姥姥",
    "text": "找我去吧 小雨啊 这一回可惹 霍露 小雨"
  },
  {
    "series": "jiayouernv",
    "ep": "011",
    "unit_id": "u0193",
    "t": [
      910.72,
      920.72
    ],
    "speaker": "姥姥",
    "text": "小雨 小雨啊 快出来吧 可惹 霍露 快来 这一项可麻烦露"
  },
  {
    "series": "jiayouernv",
    "ep": "011",
    "unit_id": "u0194",
    "t": [
      921.12,
      922.72
    ],
    "speaker": "夏雨",
    "text": "我都听见了 她输了"
  },
  {
    "series": "jiayouernv",
    "ep": "011",
    "unit_id": "u0195",
    "t": [
      923.52,
      926.32
    ],
    "speaker": "姥姥",
    "text": "输得可惨了 五比零啊"
  },
  {
    "series": "jiayouernv",
    "ep": "011",
    "unit_id": "u0196",
    "t": [
      927.32,
      932.32
    ],
    "speaker": "夏雨",
    "text": "接我母母那大沙袋 刘星 打的之荒有"
  },
  {
    "series": "jiayouernv",
    "ep": "011",
    "unit_id": "u0197",
    "t": [
      932.92,
      937.92
    ],
    "speaker": "姥姥",
    "text": "我不比沙袋轻多了 老老保护你"
  },
  {
    "series": "jiayouernv",
    "ep": "011",
    "unit_id": "u0198",
    "t": [
      938.12,
      943.72
    ],
    "speaker": "夏雨",
    "text": "您的保护我 同学们都说 刘星比太森还厉害呢"
  },
  {
    "series": "jiayouernv",
    "ep": "011",
    "unit_id": "u0199",
    "t": [
      944.92,
      949.12
    ],
    "speaker": "姥姥",
    "text": "就那个 打拳机的太森 专严耳头的那个"
  },
  {
    "series": "jiayouernv",
    "ep": "011",
    "unit_id": "u0200",
    "t": [
      950.92,
      952.72
    ],
    "speaker": "姥姥",
    "text": "刘星还没有他厉害"
  },
  {
    "series": "jiayouernv",
    "ep": "011",
    "unit_id": "u0201",
    "t": [
      952.72,
      955.52
    ],
    "speaker": "夏雨",
    "text": "刘星跟别人打架 别人的鼻子"
  },
  {
    "series": "jiayouernv",
    "ep": "011",
    "unit_id": "u0202",
    "t": [
      956.32,
      965.12
    ],
    "speaker": "姥姥",
    "text": "那咱也不怕 他还敢要老个鼻子 你就跟老了这屋呆着 我啊 去找你爸妈商领钱"
  },
  {
    "series": "jiayouernv",
    "ep": "011",
    "unit_id": "u0203",
    "t": [
      967.12,
      968.12
    ],
    "speaker": "夏雨",
    "text": "你要叫我"
  },
  {
    "series": "jiayouernv",
    "ep": "011",
    "unit_id": "u0204",
    "t": [
      968.72,
      972.52
    ],
    "speaker": "姥姥",
    "text": "行 听话就在这呆着 别动啊"
  },
  {
    "series": "jiayouernv",
    "ep": "011",
    "unit_id": "u0205",
    "t": [
      981.32,
      987.72
    ],
    "speaker": "姥姥",
    "text": "有你们怎么当爹妈的吗 眼看那俩孩子都快打起来了 你们还跟没事儿儿似的"
  },
  {
    "series": "jiayouernv",
    "ep": "011",
    "unit_id": "u0206",
    "t": [
      988.92,
      990.32
    ],
    "speaker": "夏东海",
    "text": "没事儿 妈妈"
  },
  {
    "series": "jiayouernv",
    "ep": "011",
    "unit_id": "u0207",
    "t": [
      990.92,
      999.52
    ],
    "speaker": "刘梅",
    "text": "妈 您别在这儿果乱行不行 您又不是不了解刘星 您见过他打人吗 就是 就是 您这可不想亲老了"
  },
  {
    "series": "jiayouernv",
    "ep": "011",
    "unit_id": "u0208",
    "t": [
      999.52,
      1000.52
    ],
    "speaker": "夏东海",
    "text": "就是 就是"
  },
  {
    "series": "jiayouernv",
    "ep": "011",
    "unit_id": "u0209",
    "t": [
      1001.52,
      1021.12
    ],
    "speaker": "姥姥",
    "text": "不是 我不是那个意思 我不是亲老了 我多管闲事 是不是 我呀 走 我走 您动不过我可告诉你 你可得给我保护好小女 你要是不拿她当亲儿子 你就不是我跪你 哎呦 妈"
  },
  {
    "series": "jiayouernv",
    "ep": "011",
    "unit_id": "u0210",
    "t": [
      1021.12,
      1023.12
    ],
    "speaker": "刘梅",
    "text": "您不是还有事儿吗 赶紧忙您的事儿去吧"
  },
  {
    "series": "jiayouernv",
    "ep": "011",
    "unit_id": "u0211",
    "t": [
      1023.12,
      1026.32
    ],
    "speaker": "姥姥",
    "text": "您走吧 外听我的 是不是 我走"
  },
  {
    "series": "jiayouernv",
    "ep": "011",
    "unit_id": "u0212",
    "t": [
      1026.72,
      1028.32
    ],
    "speaker": "夏东海",
    "text": "您是她亲老了"
  },
  {
    "series": "jiayouernv",
    "ep": "011",
    "unit_id": "u0213",
    "t": [
      1028.52,
      1031.72
    ],
    "speaker": "刘梅",
    "text": "行 怎么 不说 闭嘴 闭嘴"
  },
  {
    "series": "jiayouernv",
    "ep": "011",
    "unit_id": "u0214",
    "t": [
      1032.52,
      1034.72
    ],
    "speaker": "夏东海",
    "text": "没事儿老的 那事是什么事"
  },
  {
    "series": "jiayouernv",
    "ep": "011",
    "unit_id": "u0215",
    "t": [
      1038.52,
      1043.92
    ],
    "speaker": "刘梅",
    "text": "说吧 你是咱们家智囊团 给点指示吧 我怎么办呢"
  },
  {
    "series": "jiayouernv",
    "ep": "011",
    "unit_id": "u0216",
    "t": [
      1044.32,
      1049.12
    ],
    "speaker": "夏东海",
    "text": "要不我找刘星谈得见 无知 小孩子的问题让她自己解决吧"
  },
  {
    "series": "jiayouernv",
    "ep": "011",
    "unit_id": "u0217",
    "t": [
      1049.72,
      1052.32
    ],
    "speaker": "刘梅",
    "text": "自己解决 真打起来怎么办"
  },
  {
    "series": "jiayouernv",
    "ep": "011",
    "unit_id": "u0218",
    "t": [
      1053.12,
      1067.12
    ],
    "speaker": "夏东海",
    "text": "不想应该不会吧 再说了 他们现在年龄还行 将来早晚得有问题 自己去解决 要不然的话 将来一遇到问题就来找你 遇到问题就来找你 能行吗 没有事儿 上吧"
  },
  {
    "series": "jiayouernv",
    "ep": "011",
    "unit_id": "u0219",
    "t": [
      1076.72,
      1082.52
    ],
    "speaker": "夏东海",
    "text": "小云啊 小 行行 小云干吗 想 她了呗"
  },
  {
    "series": "jiayouernv",
    "ep": "011",
    "unit_id": "u0220",
    "t": [
      1082.92,
      1084.12
    ],
    "speaker": "刘星",
    "text": "好想的"
  },
  {
    "series": "jiayouernv",
    "ep": "011",
    "unit_id": "u0221",
    "t": [
      1085.12,
      1088.72
    ],
    "speaker": "夏东海",
    "text": "你是想 她往你鞋里到的那半杯牛奶吧"
  },
  {
    "series": "jiayouernv",
    "ep": "011",
    "unit_id": "u0222",
    "t": [
      1090.32,
      1092.72
    ],
    "speaker": "刘星",
    "text": "我是那种新兴侠带的人吗"
  },
  {
    "series": "jiayouernv",
    "ep": "011",
    "unit_id": "u0223",
    "t": [
      1093.72,
      1094.72
    ],
    "speaker": "夏东海",
    "text": "让我看看"
  },
  {
    "series": "jiayouernv",
    "ep": "011",
    "unit_id": "u0224",
    "t": [
      1094.72,
      1097.72
    ],
    "speaker": "刘星",
    "text": "应该干 有那么 一堆一堆"
  },
  {
    "series": "jiayouernv",
    "ep": "011",
    "unit_id": "u0225",
    "t": [
      1099.92,
      1103.52
    ],
    "speaker": "夏东海",
    "text": "好了 好了 我知道你不是 去吧 小云在老老房间"
  },
  {
    "series": "jiayouernv",
    "ep": "011",
    "unit_id": "u0226",
    "t": [
      1104.52,
      1107.12
    ],
    "speaker": "刘星",
    "text": "小云 小云"
  },
  {
    "series": "jiayouernv",
    "ep": "011",
    "unit_id": "u0227",
    "t": [
      1109.12,
      1117.12
    ],
    "speaker": "刘星",
    "text": "小云 行 小云 藏在这儿啊 还要找不找你"
  },
  {
    "series": "jiayouernv",
    "ep": "011",
    "unit_id": "u0228",
    "t": [
      1117.52,
      1119.52
    ],
    "speaker": "夏雨",
    "text": "老王就离了 老王"
  },
  {
    "series": "jiayouernv",
    "ep": "011",
    "unit_id": "u0229",
    "t": [
      1119.52,
      1124.72
    ],
    "speaker": "刘星",
    "text": "躺什么呀 躺着我 站住 小云"
  },
  {
    "series": "jiayouernv",
    "ep": "011",
    "unit_id": "u0230",
    "t": [
      1126.52,
      1129.12
    ],
    "speaker": "刘星",
    "text": "你还藏什么呀 我都看得你了 出来"
  },
  {
    "series": "jiayouernv",
    "ep": "011",
    "unit_id": "u0231",
    "t": [
      1131.72,
      1146.32
    ],
    "speaker": "刘星",
    "text": "长年大 躲得过初一 躲不过十五 法王会会数而不老 重新做人 回头十二 谈白从宽 看俱从言"
  },
  {
    "series": "jiayouernv",
    "ep": "011",
    "unit_id": "u0232",
    "t": [
      1147.92,
      1153.72
    ],
    "speaker": "刘星",
    "text": "你还不出来是不是 我再给你最后十秒钟 我告诉了"
  },
  {
    "series": "jiayouernv",
    "ep": "011",
    "unit_id": "u0233",
    "t": [
      1155.32,
      1172.72
    ],
    "speaker": "刘星",
    "text": "十 九 八 七 六 五 四 三 二 二点二 二点二 二点二"
  },
  {
    "series": "jiayouernv",
    "ep": "011",
    "unit_id": "u0234",
    "t": [
      1173.72,
      1175.72
    ],
    "speaker": "夏雨",
    "text": "你接吧 二点"
  },
  {
    "series": "jiayouernv",
    "ep": "011",
    "unit_id": "u0235",
    "t": [
      1176.72,
      1182.72
    ],
    "speaker": "刘星",
    "text": "我这不给你机会了吗 当过初来 初来的初来的 初来的 那不出来还不行吗"
  },
  {
    "series": "jiayouernv",
    "ep": "011",
    "unit_id": "u0236",
    "t": [
      1184.72,
      1190.72
    ],
    "speaker": "刘星",
    "text": "小云同志 我要 感谢你 我得拥抱你一下 来"
  },
  {
    "series": "jiayouernv",
    "ep": "011",
    "unit_id": "u0237",
    "t": [
      1190.72,
      1194.72
    ],
    "speaker": "夏雨",
    "text": "对不起 我不应该把牛奶爱 倒在你球鞋里"
  },
  {
    "series": "jiayouernv",
    "ep": "011",
    "unit_id": "u0238",
    "t": [
      1195.72,
      1202.72
    ],
    "speaker": "刘星",
    "text": "跟你说 倒得对 倒得好 要不是你把牛奶 倒我鞋里 还没有五比零呢"
  },
  {
    "series": "jiayouernv",
    "ep": "011",
    "unit_id": "u0239",
    "t": [
      1203.72,
      1204.72
    ],
    "speaker": "夏雨",
    "text": "错了还不行吗"
  },
  {
    "series": "jiayouernv",
    "ep": "011",
    "unit_id": "u0240",
    "t": [
      1205.72,
      1208.72
    ],
    "speaker": "刘星",
    "text": "瞧给你瞎的 我真想感谢你 来拥抱"
  },
  {
    "series": "jiayouernv",
    "ep": "011",
    "unit_id": "u0241",
    "t": [
      1209.72,
      1215.72
    ],
    "speaker": "夏雨",
    "text": "哥 你今天输了 明天还是牛 如果你要是负了的话 那可真不好了"
  },
  {
    "series": "jiayouernv",
    "ep": "011",
    "unit_id": "u0242",
    "t": [
      1216.72,
      1219.72
    ],
    "speaker": "刘星",
    "text": "你瞎说什么 我们五比零零了"
  },
  {
    "series": "jiayouernv",
    "ep": "011",
    "unit_id": "u0243",
    "t": [
      1219.72,
      1220.72
    ],
    "speaker": "夏雨",
    "text": "真的"
  },
  {
    "series": "jiayouernv",
    "ep": "011",
    "unit_id": "u0244",
    "t": [
      1220.72,
      1236.72
    ],
    "speaker": "刘星",
    "text": "那么当然了 我穿上我那双 奶球鞋 一上马 精神换发 就跟呗看模一样 上你 当不当当三秒 三比零 我来一帮的起码 后来你才怎么拿 我们对五比零大上他们"
  },
  {
    "series": "jiayouernv",
    "ep": "011",
    "unit_id": "u0245",
    "t": [
      1238.72,
      1243.72
    ],
    "speaker": "刘星",
    "text": "我们老师说了 中国足球的前程 就看我 当然了"
  },
  {
    "series": "jiayouernv",
    "ep": "011",
    "unit_id": "u0246",
    "t": [
      1243.72,
      1245.72
    ],
    "speaker": "刘梅",
    "text": "你说老师没吃喝药了"
  },
  {
    "series": "jiayouernv",
    "ep": "011",
    "unit_id": "u0247",
    "t": [
      1246.72,
      1249.72
    ],
    "speaker": "夏雨",
    "text": "老师就这么说的 有喝"
  },
  {
    "series": "jiayouernv",
    "ep": "011",
    "unit_id": "u0248",
    "t": [
      1249.72,
      1253.72
    ],
    "speaker": "刘梅",
    "text": "那你们老师的眼力够独的 这得在多的进食里 你心眼镜"
  },
  {
    "series": "jiayouernv",
    "ep": "011",
    "unit_id": "u0249",
    "t": [
      1253.72,
      1258.72
    ],
    "speaker": "刘星",
    "text": "我们老师是这么说的 中国足球的前程 就看过我们这一带了"
  },
  {
    "series": "jiayouernv",
    "ep": "011",
    "unit_id": "u0250",
    "t": [
      1259.72,
      1261.72
    ],
    "speaker": "刘梅",
    "text": "你得给我把这这一带给 撒嘴加上"
  },
  {
    "series": "jiayouernv",
    "ep": "011",
    "unit_id": "u0251",
    "t": [
      1261.72,
      1263.72
    ],
    "speaker": "夏东海",
    "text": "要不是看你们老师 还真有点病"
  },
  {
    "series": "jiayouernv",
    "ep": "011",
    "unit_id": "u0252",
    "t": [
      1263.72,
      1270.72
    ],
    "speaker": "刘梅",
    "text": "没错 我现在宣布 由于刘星这次表现不错 我决定 给他讲例"
  },
  {
    "series": "jiayouernv",
    "ep": "011",
    "unit_id": "u0253",
    "t": [
      1271.72,
      1273.72
    ],
    "speaker": "刘星",
    "text": "给我买双新球鞋"
  },
  {
    "series": "jiayouernv",
    "ep": "011",
    "unit_id": "u0254",
    "t": [
      1273.72,
      1276.72
    ],
    "speaker": "夏东海",
    "text": "可以 就是那种买牛身的"
  },
  {
    "series": "jiayouernv",
    "ep": "011",
    "unit_id": "u0255",
    "t": [
      1277.72,
      1278.72
    ],
    "speaker": "刘星",
    "text": "牛奶泡的那种"
